dk"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/NetworkApi":{"role":"symbol","title":"NetworkApi","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/NetworkApi","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NetworkApi"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tenant’s network segments and the RADIUS reply profile each owns (RADIUS Live profile): a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"segment is a node of the reserved \/network subtree of the resource tree (kind, VLAN,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Filter-Id envelope, placement rank), and its profile is the typed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam-radius-reply\/1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a decision renders. Every write is conditional on the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":" the caller read and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passes the server’s write gate. The tenant’s Session-Timeout cap is one more row of it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(get_policy, replace_policy): lowering it is always allowed, raising it is allowed and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"audited. The decision route FreeRADIUS calls is not in this registry."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/networkapi","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NetworkApi"}]}}}